findings.description:
The inventory appears in the Technical Scope table (:31–41), the Component Structure table (:70–78), the Migration Plan (:82, :89–92), and the verification counts (:149–151). Exclusions appear in Technical Scope (:45–52), TD-2 and TD-3 (:100–106), and "Deferred" (:126–129). These copies have already drifted (see the count finding). Cut:
- the Component Structure table, since Technical Scope names every file and count;
- TD-2 and TD-3, since the Excluded bullets carry the reasoning;
- the "Deferred" section, which repeats Excluded;
- the Value section, which restates the parent plan entry.
Keep TD-1 (a real decision), the step order, and the corrected verification commands. The sabotage-and-revert typo check (:153) is optional, since the `as const` property check is compile-checked by construction.
